Source: ocode
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ocode contributors <dev@ocode.local>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-virtualenv, python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/example/ocode

Package: ocode
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ripgrep, git
Suggests: xclip | wl-clipboard
Description: smart, Odoo-aware code editor for the terminal
 ocode is a Textual-based TUI editor for Odoo developers: editing,
 module navigation, server run/update/logs/shell, static Odoo
 intelligence and boilerplate generators.
 .
 This package bundles its Python dependencies in a private virtualenv
 (/opt/ocode) via dh-virtualenv, since recent Textual/pylint-odoo are
 not in Ubuntu archives.
